The referenced work is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. It did
not contain an upstream NOTICE file at the verified revision. This adaptation
has been substantially changed: generated legacy actions and sensors were
replaced with a curated Attune action surface using current GA Kubernetes APIs,
the maintained Python Kubernetes dynamic client, Attune Key credentials, and
hardened safety controls.

